 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Centipede Shroud — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, your technique increases by leaps and bounds. As an action for 8 cursed energy, you can launch up to 3 giant centipedes at targets within 120 feet, making a ranged cursed energy attack roll for each. On a hit, they deal 8d10 necrotic damage and the target must make a Strength saving throw. On a failure, the target is pushed or pulled 30ft closer or further (your choice) and falls prone.<br />\n Additionally, you can now have two cursed centipedes summoned at a time. While you have two cursed centipedes acting as your shroud, you can make 2 melee attacks as a bonus action and instead add 3 + your proficiency bonus to your AC.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
